<title>USA: May Department August same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>May Department August same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $859.3     $728.7     +17.9	 +7.9</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $5,695     $5,095     +11.8	 +4.9</p>
<p>NOTE: Sales have been restated to exclude the sales of stores that have been closed and not replaced. Year-to-date revenues, including the sales of nonreplaced closed stores and finance charge revenue, were $5.93 billion in 1996 and $5.3 billion in 1995. During the month, May opened two Lord &amp; Taylor stores.  </p>
<p>Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is   four weeks ended Aug 31.</p>
<p>Full company name is May Department Stores Co.</p>
</text>
